        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heating, sanitary equipment cogen unit 160kWe</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heating, sanitary equipment cogen unit 160kWe
Inventory refers to infrastructure of an existing natural gas cogeneration plant (lambda=1 motor, 160kWe, operation start 1987) at Jakobsberg, Basel, Switzerland. (Life time for operation assumed 100'000 h.);
UUID: d11b7fe6-ef4f-316e-bafd-b7fff105bcf8
The module includes the most important materials used for production. It includes also the transport of these materials and the energy and water needed for production.
Location: Data refers to a plant in Switzerland, assumed valid for Europe (RER)
Technology: Component of a specific cogeneration unit installed in Switzerland. Technology at end of 1980s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d11b7fe6-ef4f-316e-bafd-b7fff105bcf8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
